  "description": "The Nishiki Altron ST E-Bike boasts advanced features that make it an exceptional choice for city commuting or countryside adventures. Equipped with an integrated 36V battery and a powerful 350W Motor, the e-bike effortlessly glides down most terrains. Offering two modes of riding, Class II - Pedal Assist and Throttle, it gives users an added bit of freedom, with a speed of up to 20 mph to keep your movements smooth and efficient. The Shimano 1 x 6 Drivetrain ensures a seamless transition between gears, while the mechanical disc brakes provide superior stopping power. The Altron ST is a perfect choice for anyone seeking an eco-friendly, efficient, and stylish way to stay on the go.Manufacturer may substitute components with components of equal or greater performance levelFeatures:350-watt rear hub motor and 36v lithium battery combine to power Pedal Assist e-Bike with throttle up to 20 mphEasy-to-read LCD display featuring 3 power assist levels25-to-35-mile battery life depending on rider settings. Charge time of 4 to 6 hours depending on level6-speed Shimano shifting drivetrain helps provide smooth and efficient gear changesMechanical disc brakes provide reliable stopping powerACT Lab certified to UL 2849FDNY/DCWP Fire Safety Materials NOTICE: Used Bikes and/or bikes purchased online that have been assembled are non-returnable. We strongly recommend that a professional bicycle mechanic properly assembles, repairs, and maintains the bicycle. DICK'S Sporting Goods will provide free in-store assembly service by a certified technician for any bicycle purchased on our website or in our stores (proof of purchase required). If you choose to assemble the bicycle yourself, DICK'S Sporting Goods is not responsible for injuries or damages resulting from improper assembly.",
